## Verdicts

```mdl
verdict HeyGenConnector: The connector entry trims the key and stores an AccessToken and Connection; no test covers it.
  status: untested
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-heygen/src/capabilities/connector.ts#createHeyGenConnectorEntry, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-heygen/src/capabilities/index.ts#Connector]
  note: |
    `onSubmit` trims, rejects an empty key and returns `{ kind: 'complete', accessToken, connection }`. The module activates
    on `ConnectorEvents.Start` rather than the `SetupConnectors` event the spec names. No test file exercises the entry.
```

```mdl
verdict HeyGenGenerationService: An async video service enqueues on /v3/videos and polls to a single video/mp4 variant.
  status: done
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-heygen/src/services/heygen-service.ts#makeHeyGenGenerationService, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-heygen/src/services/heygen-provider.ts#HeyGenProvider]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-heygen/src/services/heygen-provider.test.ts]
  walkthrough:
    - The service wires the provider to the edge CORS proxy and maps the polled URL to one video/mp4 variant. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-heygen/src/services/heygen-service.ts#makeHeyGenGenerationService
    - The provider posts the avatar body with X-Api-Key, polls until completed or failed, and raises MissingApiKey or ProviderFailure. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-heygen/src/services/heygen-provider.ts#HeyGenProvider
```

```mdl
verdict HeyGenFieldOptions: fieldOptions lists the account's own avatars and voices for the studio comboboxes.
  status: done
